# Shell and Python scripts must stay LF: they run in Linux containers, macOS, and
# WSL (plugin hooks, the detect/guard preflight, skill helpers). Without this, a
# contributor with core.autocrlf=true checks them out as CRLF and bash fails with
# "syntax error: unexpected end of file". Pin the line endings regardless of local git config.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf

# PowerShell scripts stay CRLF (Windows-native).
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
